={
  "query": "Research {{ $json.company.name}} as a potential B2B GTM prospect in India. Find recent credible public information about this company, prioritizing the last 12 months. Identify evidence of job changes, promotions, departures, important new hires, leadership changes or leadership-change intent, recent funding, aggressive hiring, rapid growth, company expansion, technology or system changes, new business lanes, website or product intent, customer sentiment, and significant negative issues or customer complaints. Focus especially on Marketing, Sales, Revenue, RevOps, Growth, and GTM. For every relevant finding, identify what happened, the person or company involved, role if applicable, date, why it matters for GTM, source URL, and supporting evidence. Do not assume a signal exists when evidence is unavailable. Distinguish confirmed evidence from weak or unavailable evidence.",
